|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 0.8b | sft | 79.06% | 0.47% | 0.1897 | 81.94% | 12.56% |
| 0.8b | continued_sft | 82.93% | 1.01% | 0.1445 | 82.63% | 9.84% |
